-- 045: Deep content + matching exercises for X09 · End-to-End Data Analysis with AI.
UPDATE public.sessions SET
 content_en = E'## AI as an analyst''s co-pilot, not autopilot\n\nAI can draft SQL, explain a chart, summarise findings, and suggest next steps in seconds. But it also invents confident nonsense. The skilled analyst uses AI to go **faster** while staying the **accountable** human who verifies every output.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Automation in the analysis workflow\n\nAI shines at the repetitive, language-shaped parts of analysis:\n\n| Step | Where AI helps | You still own |\n|------|----------------|---------------|\n| Understand data | Explain columns, suggest checks | Knowing the business |\n| Write queries/code | Draft SQL/pandas from a description | Confirming it is correct |\n| Interpret | Summarise patterns in plain words | Judging what matters |\n| Communicate | Draft the narrative & slide text | The final claim & sign-off |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Agentic AI — what it is (and is not)\n\n**Agentic AI** runs multiple steps toward a goal without you prompting each one — e.g. "profile this dataset, find anomalies, and draft a summary". It plans, calls tools, and iterates.\n\n> It is **not** a source of truth. An agent can chain five steps and be wrong at step one — so the further it runs unsupervised, the more you must verify the end result.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Prompting for end-to-end analysis\n\nA strong analysis prompt has four parts:\n\n| Part | Example |\n|------|---------|\n| **Context** | "You have a sales table: date, category, region, revenue." |\n| **Task** | "Find the top 3 categories by revenue growth Q1→Q2." |\n| **Format** | "Return a table plus a 2-sentence insight." |\n| **Constraints** | "Only use the columns given; state assumptions." |\n\nThen **iterate**: run it, check the output, and refine ("the growth % looks off — show your calculation").\n\n---\n\n## 4. Validating AI output — the non-negotiable step\n\n- **Recompute a sample.** Re-run one number the AI gave against the real data.\n- **Ask for its working.** "Show the query/steps" — verify the logic, not just the answer.\n- **Watch for hallucinations.** Invented column names, impossible totals, fabricated citations.\n- **Protect privacy.** Never paste customer PII or secrets into a public tool; anonymise or use an approved environment.\n\n> **Mini case study.** An analyst asked an AI for "average order value by region". It returned a clean table — but had silently included cancelled orders. A 30-second recheck against the source caught it before it reached the deck.\n\n---\n\n## Common pitfalls\n\n- **Trusting a confident answer** without recomputing.\n- **Vague prompts** ("analyse this") that return generic filler.\n- **Pasting sensitive data** into an unapproved tool.\n- **Letting the AI define the question** — the business question is yours to set.\n\n---\n\n## Glossary\n\n| Term | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| Automation | Letting software repeat a defined process |\n| Agentic AI | AI that runs multi-step tasks toward a goal |\n| Prompt | The instruction you give the AI |\n| Hallucination | Confident but false AI output |\n| Verification | Recomputing/checking AI output against the source |\n\n---\n\n## Key Takeaways\n\n1. Use AI to go **faster**; you remain **accountable** for correctness.\n2. AI helps most with drafting queries, interpreting, and communicating — not deciding what matters.\n3. **Agentic AI** chains steps toward a goal, so verify the end result carefully.\n4. Write prompts with **context + task + format + constraints**, then iterate.\n5. **Always validate**: recompute a sample, ask for the working, and protect data privacy.\n\n> 💡 Practice with the matching exercises below, then run a prompt-and-verify loop on the assignment case.',
 content_id = E'## AI sebagai co-pilot analyst, bukan autopilot\n\nAI bisa membuat draf SQL, menjelaskan chart, meringkas temuan, dan menyarankan langkah berikutnya dalam hitungan detik. Tapi ia juga mengarang omong kosong dengan percaya diri. Analyst yang terampil memakai AI untuk lebih **cepat** sambil tetap menjadi **manusia yang bertanggung jawab** yang memverifikasi setiap output.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Automation dalam alur analisis\n\nAI unggul di bagian analisis yang berulang dan berbentuk bahasa:\n\n| Langkah | Di mana AI membantu | Anda tetap memegang |\n|---------|---------------------|---------------------|\n| Memahami data | Menjelaskan kolom, menyarankan cek | Paham bisnisnya |\n| Menulis query/kode | Draf SQL/pandas dari deskripsi | Memastikan benar |\n| Menafsirkan | Meringkas pola dengan bahasa sederhana | Menilai apa yang penting |\n| Mengomunikasikan | Draf narasi & teks slide | Klaim akhir & tanda tangan |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Agentic AI — apa itu (dan bukan)\n\n**Agentic AI** menjalankan banyak langkah menuju tujuan tanpa Anda memandu tiap satu — mis. "profil dataset ini, temukan anomali, dan buat draf ringkasan". Ia merencanakan, memanggil tool, dan beriterasi.\n\n> Ia **bukan** sumber kebenaran. Agen bisa merangkai lima langkah dan salah di langkah pertama — jadi makin jauh ia berjalan tanpa pengawasan, makin Anda harus memverifikasi hasil akhirnya.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Prompting untuk analisis end-to-end\n\nPrompt analisis yang kuat punya empat bagian:\n\n| Bagian | Contoh |\n|--------|--------|\n| **Konteks** | "Anda punya tabel penjualan: date, category, region, revenue." |\n| **Tugas** | "Temukan 3 kategori teratas berdasarkan pertumbuhan revenue Q1→Q2." |\n| **Format** | "Kembalikan tabel plus insight 2 kalimat." |\n| **Batasan** | "Hanya pakai kolom yang diberikan; sebutkan asumsi." |\n\nLalu **iterasi**: jalankan, cek output, dan perbaiki ("% pertumbuhan tampak salah — tunjukkan perhitunganmu").\n\n---\n\n## 4. Memvalidasi output AI — langkah yang tak bisa ditawar\n\n- **Hitung ulang sampel.** Jalankan ulang satu angka dari AI terhadap data asli.\n- **Minta cara kerjanya.** "Tunjukkan query/langkahnya" — verifikasi logikanya, bukan hanya jawabannya.\n- **Waspadai halusinasi.** Nama kolom karangan, total mustahil, sitasi fiktif.\n- **Lindungi privasi.** Jangan pernah menempel PII pelanggan atau rahasia ke tool publik; anonimkan atau pakai lingkungan yang disetujui.\n\n> **Studi kasus mini.** Seorang analyst meminta AI "rata-rata nilai order per region". AI mengembalikan tabel rapi — tapi diam-diam menyertakan order yang dibatalkan. Cek ulang 30 detik terhadap sumber menangkapnya sebelum masuk ke deck.\n\n---\n\n## Kesalahan umum\n\n- **Memercayai jawaban percaya diri** tanpa menghitung ulang.\n- **Prompt samar** ("analisis ini") yang mengembalikan pengisi generik.\n- **Menempel data sensitif** ke tool yang tak disetujui.\n- **Membiarkan AI menentukan pertanyaan** — pertanyaan bisnis adalah tanggung jawab Anda.\n\n---\n\n## Glosarium\n\n| Istilah | Arti |\n|---------|------|\n| Automation | Membiarkan software mengulang proses yang terdefinisi |\n| Agentic AI | AI yang menjalankan tugas multi-langkah menuju tujuan |\n| Prompt | Instruksi yang Anda berikan ke AI |\n| Halusinasi | Output AI yang percaya diri tapi salah |\n| Verifikasi | Menghitung ulang/mengecek output AI terhadap sumber |\n\n---\n\n## Kesimpulan Utama\n\n1. Pakai AI untuk lebih **cepat**; Anda tetap **bertanggung jawab** atas kebenaran.\n2. AI paling membantu untuk draf query, menafsirkan, dan mengomunikasikan — bukan memutuskan apa yang penting.\n3. **Agentic AI** merangkai langkah menuju tujuan, jadi verifikasi hasil akhir dengan cermat.\n4. Tulis prompt dengan **konteks + tugas + format + batasan**, lalu iterasi.\n5. **Selalu validasi**: hitung ulang sampel, minta cara kerjanya, dan lindungi privasi data.\n\n> 💡 Latih dengan exercise matching di bawah, lalu jalankan loop prompt-dan-verifikasi pada case tugas.'
WHERE session_number = 'X09';

INSERT INTO public.exercises (session_id, type, title_en, title_id, description_en, description_id, starter_code, solution_code, test_cases, hints_en, hints_id, difficulty, order_num)
SELECT s.id, 'matching', 'AI Terms', 'Istilah AI',
  'Match each AI term to its meaning.', 'Cocokkan setiap istilah AI dengan artinya.',
  '{"pairs":[{"left":"Automation","right":"Software repeating a defined process"},{"left":"Agentic AI","right":"AI running multi-step tasks toward a goal"},{"left":"Prompt","right":"The instruction given to the AI"},{"left":"Hallucination","right":"Confident but false AI output"}]}','',
  '[{"id":"tc1","validation_type":"matching","expected_value":"Software repeating a defined process","description_en":"Automation","description_id":"Automation","points":25},{"id":"tc2","validation_type":"matching","expected_value":"AI running multi-step tasks toward a goal","description_en":"Agentic","description_id":"Agentic","points":25},{"id":"tc3","validation_type":"matching","expected_value":"The instruction given to the AI","description_en":"Prompt","description_id":"Prompt","points":25},{"id":"tc4","validation_type":"matching","expected_value":"Confident but false AI output","description_en":"Hallucination","description_id":"Halusinasi","points":25}]',
  '["A prompt is your instruction","Hallucination = confidently wrong"]','["Prompt adalah instruksi Anda","Halusinasi = salah tapi yakin"]','easy',1
FROM public.sessions s WHERE s.session_number='X09' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.exercises e WHERE e.session_id=s.id AND e.title_en='AI Terms');

